{"id":"u-64aca858-ab69-4227-b289-4d67774ecae7","src":"community","title":"Two Step","author":"John O.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/Pjf7Kw-two-step","desc":"Inspired by a number of influencers promoting 2X2 type training. Started this after years of powerlifting that resulted in a jacked up MRI. This program is for the older lifter who needs to change it up for longevity. It minimizes axial loading and focuses on maintaining strength and tone while protecting the joints, ligaments and tendons. \n\nProgression should be based on when 15 reps of any given exercise gets easy. Increase weight slowly , think 2.5 or 5 pound increments. \n\nRest 60 to 90 seconds in-between sets. 2 minutes in-between movements. \n\nI tend to do 1 day per week of level 2 cardio for 45 minutes to a hour and 1 day a week of level 4 cardio, Tabata style , at least 3, 4 minute rounds.","level":["Beginner","Intermediate"],"goals":["Muscle","Women's"],"equipment":["Garage Gym"],"minutes":40,"joins":1,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-03-15T02:39:50.786Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Day 1","Day 2"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":7,"x":2}]},{"n":"Lat Pulldown","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":7,"x":2}]},{"n":"Belt Squat","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":7,"x":2}]},{"n":"Glute-Ham Raise","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":7,"x":2}]},{"n":"Bicep Curl (EZ Bar)","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":7,"x":2}]},{"n":"Tricep Extension (Cable)","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":7,"x":2}]},{"n":"Face Pull","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":7,"x":2}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Cable)","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":7,"x":2}]},{"n":"Hanging Leg Raise","sets":[{"r":15,"x":2}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Cable Crossover","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":7,"x":2}]},{"n":"Chest Supported Row (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":7,"x":2}]},{"n":"Goblet Squat","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":7,"x":2}]},{"n":"Pull Through (Cable)","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":7,"x":2}]},{"n":"Bicep Curl (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":7,"x":2}]},{"n":"Tricep Pushdown (Cable)","sets":[{"r":12,"rp